Package: alder
Title: Reactive Notebook for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carl", "Stone", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "carl@alder.dev")
Description: A modern reactive notebook environment for R. Plain-text .R
    notebook files are statically analyzed into a dependency DAG and executed
    in dependency order, with a marimo-inspired UX and app mode. Change the
    code in a cell and downstream cells are marked stale; run a cell and its
    stale dependents re-execute in order.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    later,
    processx,
    R6
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    curl,
    ggplot2,
    htmlwidgets
Config/testthat/edition: 3
